          "text": "Description: During the night of October 28 to 29, 1976, between 4:00 and 4:45 a.m., several people reported a bright light phenomenon in the sky. A stationary circular object emitted a very intense white light. There were few details provided about the possible altitude of the object. These people likely made an astronomical observation.",
